### billing health
GET http://localhost:8087/actuator/health
X-Request-Id: manual-billing-health

### billing liveness
GET http://localhost:8087/actuator/health/liveness

### billing prometheus
GET http://localhost:8087/actuator/prometheus

### P16 plans (public)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/plans

### P16 one plan
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/plans/premium

### P16 checkout (step-up: a token from a login in the last 10 minutes). pm_mock_success | pm_mock_decline |
### pm_mock_insufficient | pm_mock_delayed | pm_mock_delayed_decline
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/subscriptions/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"plan": "PREMIUM", "paymentMethod": "pm_mock_success", "billingState": "KA"}

### P16 the account's subscription
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/subscriptions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### P16 cancel at period end (step-up)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/subscriptions/me:cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### P16 entitlements (cached 60 s)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/entitlements/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### P16 invoices (keyset)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/invoices?limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### P16 a webhook without a signature: 400 WEBHOOK_SIGNATURE_INVALID
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/webhooks/mock
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "evt_manual", "type": "payment.succeeded", "data": {}}
